@DefineProject
	@Name		= "Zinc Demonstration"
	@Version	= "3.50"
	
	@Subdir		= "\\ZINCDEMO"
	@OutDrive	= C
	@Requires	@HardDisk
@EndProject


@GetOption
	@LocalWindow(15, 40)
	@Option 1 = "Continue"
	@Option 2 = "Exit"
	@Option 3 = "Abort"
	@Cls
	             Zinc Application Framework 3.5 Demonstration

	This demonstration disk contains executable programs that were
	compiled from one set of source code and linked with Zinc Application 
	Framework 3.5.   Zinc is a multiplatform, object-oriented development
	tool that supports DOS Text, DOS Graphics, Microsoft Windows,
	Windows NT, IBM OS/2, IBM PenDOS and OSF/Motif.











	To install these programs onto your hard disk, press the <Enter>
	key.  To cancel the installation, select "Exit" and press <Enter>.
@EndOption


@If (2 [= @Option || 3 [= @Option)
	@Display
	@Cls

	Installation terminated.


	@Abort

	@EndDisplay
@EndIf


@GetOutDrive
	@LocalWindow(11,40)
	@Suppress A
	@Suppress B
	@Cls

	Please select the drive to which you would like to install Zinc
	Application Framework 3.5 Demonstration.














	Use the <Up-Arrow> and <Down-Arrow> keys to move the selection bar
	to the drive to which you would like to install Zinc Application
	Framework 3.5 Demonstration and press the <Enter> key.
@EndOutDrive


@GetSubdir
	@LocalWindow(11, 50)	
	@Prompt = " @OutDrive:\\ "
	@Cls
	@CLS

	Please specify the path on drive @OutDrive: where you would like to install
	Zinc Application Framework 3.5 Demonstration.














	Type the path where you wish to install Zinc Application Framework
	3.5 Demonstration and press the <Enter> key.  To accept the default
	path, press <Enter>.
@EndSubdir

@DefineDisk
	@Label = "Zinc Demos"

	@File read.me
	@BeginLib zincdemo.red
		 @File *.* @Out *.*
	@EndLib
@EndDisk

@Finish
	@ChDrive @OutDrive
	@ChDir "@Subdir"
	@Cls
            *** Zinc Application Framework 3.5 Demonstration ***

These demonstration programs were created with Zinc Application Framework 3.5.
The DOS Text, DOS Graphics, Microsoft Windows, and IBM OS/2 versions were
compiled from the same source code (ZINCDEMO.CPP) and share the same platform-
independent resource file (ZINCPOST.DAT).

To run the demo, enter: "ZINC_DOS" for DOS Graphics Mode
                        "ZINC_DOS /T" for DOS Text Mode 
                        "WIN ZINC_WIN" for Microsoft Windows
                        "ZINC_OS2" for IBM OS/2 (you must run IBM OS/2) 
           
For more information or to order, call or write:

United States:                        Europe:
  Zinc Software Incorporated            Zinc Software (UK) Limited
  405 South 100 East 2nd Floor          58-60 Beresford Street
  Pleasant Grove, Utah 84062 USA        London, SE18 6BG United Kingdom
  Tel: (801) 785-8900                   Tel: +44 (0)81 855 9918
  Fax: (801) 785-8996                   Fax: +44 (0)81 316 7778
  BBS: (801) 785-8997                   BBS: +44 (0)81 317 2310
@Pause
@EndFinish

